{"type":"message","id":"8f7d0933","parentId":"92b87418","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:35:35.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that sending images frequently will cause the session to grow large over time. I should address this and suggest strategies to handle it.","thinkingSignature":"8b7318d49e8b73ffa314eea15b52a301789730fad1b70bc5ed07de94b93c9a98"},{"type":"text","text":"对，图片是最\"重\"的——每张图片都会占很多 token，几张下来 session 就膨胀得很快。\n\n**针对图片场景的建议：**\n\n**① 图片处理完立刻 /new（最直接）**\n发图片 → 我识别/录题 → 任务完成 → 你 `/new` 开新会话。图片的上下文基本不需要留着。\n\n**② 错题录入走\"专用短对话\"**\n每次发错题图片，就当成一次独立任务：发图 → 我录入 → 确认 → 结束。不要在同一个 session 里连续发很多张。\n\n**③ 我来提醒**\n我在 HEARTBEAT.md 里再加一条：**连续收到 3 张以上图片后，主动提醒你 /new 一下**。\n\n要加这条规则吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4248,"output":300,"cacheRead":35108,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39656,"cost":{"input":0.0012744,"output":0.00035999999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00210648,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00374088}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776152121514,"responseId":"062d213a481ca83385b51d7d8a9cc31e"}}
