{"type":"message","id":"565a99a2","parentId":"8c154638","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:43:38.117Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the installed skills are:\n\n1. biology-tutor - 兮兮生物辅导\n2. geography-tutor - 兮兮地理辅导\n3. getnote - Get笔记\n4. language-learning-tutor - 多语言AI导师\n5. math-tutor - 兮兮数学辅导\n6. openclaw-find-skills - 查找安装新skill\n7. self-improving-agent - 持续改进\n8. skill-interview-builder - 访谈创建Skill\n9. skill-vetter - Skill安全审查\n10. yuwen-tutor - 兮兮语文辅导\n\nThe zip files are likely the original distribution packages.\n\nI don't think I need to mention the zip files specifically - those are just distribution archives.","thinkingSignature":"32e47b8c499d75ba85274e0146e235cf121343e09fecaab9b2815bcade182106"},{"type":"text","text":"当前安装的技能（skills）：\n\n**学习辅导类**\n- 📐 math-tutor — 兮兮数学错题分析\n- 🧬 biology-tutor — 兮兮生物辅导\n- 🌍 geography-tutor — 兮兮地理辅导\n- 📝 yuwen-tutor — 兮兮语文辅导\n- 🌐 language-learning-tutor — 多语言AI导师（英语为主）\n\n**效率工具类**\n- 📚 getnote — Get笔记读写管理\n- 🔍 openclaw-find-skills — 查找/安装新技能\n\n**系统类**\n- 🛡️ skill-vetter — Skill安全审查（安装前必查）\n- 🛠️ skill-interview-builder — 访谈式创建新Skill\n- 📈 self-improving-agent — 错误学习与持续改进\n\n共 10 个skill，还有一堆 `.zip` 备份包 🙂"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5170,"output":331,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31652,"cost":{"input":0.0015509999999999999,"output":0.0003972,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0035172599999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776152605754,"responseId":"062d231ed9efd77016fac29a2562e4d0"}}
