{"type":"message","id":"afb12ebb","parentId":"5677a405","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:57:49.944Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"频哥分享了一个使用龙虾的技巧 - 飞书消息模型有响应但长时间没有回复，是因为 session 太大需要 /new。这是一个很有价值的经验，我应该记录到 learnings 里。","thinkingSignature":"346da008088d693895832718c274e6973e35ffd942510df9dc48eb7967e7a472"},{"type":"text","text":"这个经验很关键，记一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3xbi46kvvvhu_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/SESSION_MGMT.md","content":"# Session 管理经验\n\n## 飞书消息模型响应慢 / 无响应（2026-04-14）\n\n**现象：** 飞书消息模型有响应，但长时间没有回复\n\n**原因：** session 规模太大，每次加载的历史信息太多，导致响应极慢\n\n**解决方法：** `/new` 开新会话\n\n**预防：**\n- 见 HEARTBEAT.md 的「Session 长度检查」和「图片防累积规则」\n- 连续处理 3+ 张图片后主动提醒 /new\n- 对话超过 30 轮后主动提醒 /new\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92,"output":216,"cacheRead":35697,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36005,"cost":{"input":0.0000276,"output":0.0002592,"cacheRead":0.00214182,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0024286200000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776153459881,"responseId":"062d26746af72b72e5ad66455bb2c88e"}}
