{"type":"message","id":"b8fc2838","parentId":"85804ce6","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:09:13.551Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found it! The key error is:\n```\nmodel not allowed: minimax/MiniMax-V06\n```\n\nThis tells me that V06 was explicitly blocked/not allowed at some point (at 09:14:03). But later at 14:56:31, there was a config reload that seems to have applied some changes to `agents.defaults.models.minimax/MiniMax-V06`.\n\nThe current error from the image tool says \"Unknown model: minimax/MiniMax-V06\" which suggests the model isn't registered properly in the system.\n\nLet me check the current model configuration more carefully to see what's happening with V06.","thinkingSignature":"506ab64191e61986de252a193a77a16c21fb9c864d52480802306fc698b34354"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_26p3wtwu4gwl_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n    models = data.get('agents', {}).get('defaults', {}).get('models', {})\n    print(json.dumps(models, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21243,"output":222,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47616,"cost":{"input":0.0063729,"output":0.00026639999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00820836}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776154145556,"responseId":"062d2922569c3c44283cc1499617bb2d"}}
