{"type":"message","id":"0757f67c","parentId":"f51396b5","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:09:40.462Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The configuration looks correct. The issue seems to be something deeper. The gateway log shows:\n1. `model not allowed: minimax/MiniMax-V06` at 09:14:03\n2. `config hot reload applied (agents.defaults.models.minimax/MiniMax-V06)` at 14:56:31\n\nBut the image tool says \"Unknown model: minimax/MiniMax-V06\".\n\nLet me look at the gateway error log around the time of the image test to see what the actual error was.\n\nActually, thinking about this more carefully - the error from the `image` tool said \"Unknown model: minimax/MiniMax-V06\". This is the OpenClaw image tool reporting that it can't find the model. \n\nSo the problem might be that when the image tool tries to use minimax/MiniMax-V06, it's hitting a route that doesn't exist or the model registry doesn't have it registered properly. Let me check the gateway error log more carefully to see what's happening when the image tool makes that call.","thinkingSignature":"952811eabaabedc4a0e54b30cd5dd162bb777b91318b5e988fca9fd10a70bf7c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dz91vn2q9gv1_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -A3 \"16:06\" ~/.openclaw/logs/gateway.err.log 2>/dev/null | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":22189,"output":266,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48606,"cost":{"input":0.0066567,"output":0.0003192,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00854496}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776154171730,"responseId":"062d293cb8b7f0cb8bf1f673f1ed063d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9cb99635","parentId":"0757f67c","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:09:40.634Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_dz91vn2q9gv1_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026-04-13T01:16:06.190+08:00 Config was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\n2026-04-13T01:16:06.192+08:00 Gateway start blocked: set gateway.mode=local (current: unset) or pass --allow-unconfigured.\n2026-04-13T01:16:06.196+08:00 Config write audit: /Users/edy/.openclaw/logs/config-audit.jsonl\nConfig was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\nConfig was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\n2026-04-13T01:16:09.051+08:00 Config was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\n--\n2026-04-14T16:06:22.874+08:00 [media-understanding] image: failed (0/1) reason=Model does not support images\n2026-04-14T16:06:33.332+08:00 [tools] image failed: Unknown model: minimax/MiniMax-V06 raw_params={\"prompt\":\"简单描述这张图片的内容\",\"image\":\"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/980cae25-a44d-41a9-85cf-3846be99b4d8.jpg\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":98,"aggregated":"2026-04-13T01:16:06.190+08:00 Config was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\n2026-04-13T01:16:06.192+08:00 Gateway start blocked: set gateway.mode=local (current: unset) or pass --allow-unconfigured.\n2026-04-13T01:16:06.196+08:00 Config write audit: /Users/edy/.openclaw/logs/config-audit.jsonl\nConfig was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\nConfig was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\n2026-04-13T01:16:09.051+08:00 Config was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.4.11); current version is 2026.4.2.\n--\n2026-04-14T16:06:22.874+08:00 [media-understanding] image: failed (0/1) reason=Model does not support images\