{"type":"message","id":"12c8896c","parentId":"174324d8","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:10:14.719Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token approach didn't work. Let me try a different approach - check the actual API endpoint that Minimax uses for listing models, or just tell the user what I found.\n\nActually, based on what I found in the gateway error log, the issue is clear: the API returned \"Model does not support images\" when trying to use MiniMax-V06 for image understanding. This means:\n\n1. The model IS recognized (V06 exists in the config)\n2. But the API key doesn't have permission to use V06's image capability\n\nThe most likely explanation is that the Plus subscription includes access to V06 for text, but the image/vision capability requires a separate enablement or the specific API key wasn't provisioned with vision support.\n\nI should report this clearly to the user.","thinkingSignature":"e38615daf2228226115ca6b5ea674e75654cfbc029101c9649596423f3196c28"},{"type":"text","text":"日志已经很说明问题了：\n\n```\n[media-understanding] image: failed reason=Model does not support images\n```\n\n**结论：**\n- OpenClaw 配置没问题，V06 识别到了\n- 实际调用时，Minimax API 返回\"该模型不支持图片\"\n- 你的 API Key 虽然是 Plus 套餐，但 **V06 的图像能力可能没有在这个 Key 上开通**\n\n**建议联系 Minimax 客服问一下：**\n> \"我的 Plus 套餐 API Key（或其对应的账户），为什么调用 MiniMax-V06 的图像理解时返回 Model does not support images？是需要单独开通吗？\"\n\n这应该是账户或套餐配置层面问题，不是我这边能解决的。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":23437,"output":301,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49889,"cost":{"input":0.007031099999999999,"output":0.0003612,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00896136}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776154201227,"responseId":"062d295a1ab7c5a3af67eaa0ccac7d42"}}
