{"type":"message","id":"b6897d2a","parentId":"d8332edf","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:41:40.949Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is providing very detailed analysis. Let me read through and understand what he's saying:\n\n1. MiniMax's ¥49 Plus subscription includes M2.7 and the Token Plan supports \"full modality\" - text, audio, video, image, and music\n2. M2.7 is described as a \"text model\" but image understanding comes through a separate `understand_image` MCP tool\n3. OpenClaw docs say image tool auto-connects to MiniMax's image understanding MCP\n4. The error \"Model does not support images\" might be a false positive from OpenClaw checking if M2.7 can natively accept image tokens, rather than checking if the image MCP is available\n5. There are community issues about this exact problem in Feishu channel\n\nHe's suggesting:\n- Step 1: Test with a direct image URL (not through Feishu upload) to see if MiniMax API key works for images\n- Step 2: Check logs for specific error keywords\n- Step 3: Don't confuse image generation quota with image understanding capability\n\nHe's asking me to share:\n1. openclaw.json sections related to MiniMax/agent/image\n2. The error text from Feishu when sending images\n3. The relevant error lines from OpenClaw logs\n\nHe wants to help me diagnose this systematically.\n\nLet me provide what he's asking for. I already have the relevant config info. Let me compile what I know and do a URL-based image test to see if MiniMax key works for image understanding.","thinkingSignature":"f97af87d4c0cedcd1790c3650db6b65307130d7990a0b089e480aabed7435c0a"},{"type":"text","text":"频哥这个分析非常到位，我把日志和配置整理给你：\n\n**① 报错原文（飞书）**\n```\n{\"image_key\":\"img_v3_0210o_14cb8b63-cf24-41e7-a2e8-846662d14f6g\"}\n```\n（没有文字报错，只是发了image_key后没有响应）\n\n**② OpenClaw 日志对应报错**\n```\n2026-04-14T16:06:22.874+08:00 [media-understanding] image: failed (0/1) reason=Model does not support images\n2026-04-14T16:06:33.332+08:00 [tools] image failed: Unknown model: minimax/MiniMax-V06\n```\n\n**③ 当前 openclaw.json 相关配置**\n```json\n// providers\n\"minimax\": {\n  \"models\": [\n    { \"id\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\", \"input\": [\"text\"] },\n    { \"id\": \"MiniMax-V06\", \"input\": [\"text\", \"image\"] }\n  ]\n}\n\n// agents.defaults\n\"model\": { \"primary\": \"minimax/MiniMax-M2.7\" },\n\"imageModel\": { \"primary\": \"minimax/MiniMax-V06\" }\n```\n\n---\n\n你说的对——日志里 `Model does not support images` 是在 `[media-understanding]` 层报的，说明是 OpenClaw 在调用 MiniMax API 时发现 V06 报了这个错，但这个\"Model\"到底是 M2.7 还是 V06 其实日志里没有明确说清楚。\n\n**我现在按你的建议做第一步：直接用图片 URL 方式测试 MiniMax API Key 本身的识图能力。**\n\n先拿到刚才那张图的外网可访问 URL：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_96do6whsgfv4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/980cae25-a44d-41a9-85cf-3846be99b4d8.jpg /tmp/test_image.jpg && echo \"copied\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92,"output":753,"cacheRead":50003,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50848,"cost":{"input":0.0000276,"output":0.0009036,"cacheRead":0.00300018,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00393138}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776156069594,"responseId":"062d30acc04a531555472ce9e8df9091"}}
