{"type":"message","id":"1430f63d","parentId":"5870364b","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:42:28.975Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API key is not stored in plain text anywhere I can access. The gateway must be handling it separately. Since I can't get the raw API key, let me try a different approach:\n\n1. Test with an image URL to see if the `image` tool can use a URL\n2. Look at the actual API call that the image tool is making\n\nActually, let me try using the image tool with a URL directly and see what error I get. The image tool should accept either a local path or a URL.","thinkingSignature":"2ff7985e336301f3cdd8160ab592dea249d0692a9b07cacdd6e5b32f6b650a11"},{"type":"text","text":"API Key 拿不到（gateway 加密存储的），换个方式直接测——**用图片 URL 发给我**，走和飞书下载完全不同的通道：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rgxcjud4hpht_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Upload test image to a temporary public URL using a simple approach\n# First check if there's a built-in way in openclaw to share media\nls ~/.openclaw/media/ 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":25710,"output":205,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52066,"cost":{"input":0.007712999999999999,"output":0.00024599999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00952806}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776156140290,"responseId":"062d30edbda84cf6b191239827dbb6a9"}}
