{"type":"message","id":"aaf8483e","parentId":"c3851640","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:43:00.970Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me think about what I can actually do here. The key diagnostic info the user wants is:\n\n1. openclaw.json config - I have this\n2. Error text from Feishu - I have this (just the image_key with no response)\n3. OpenClaw logs - I have these\n\nBut what I CAN'T do easily is test the Minimax API directly because I don't have the API key.\n\nHowever, the user says there are community issues about this. Let me check if there's an update available for OpenClaw that might fix the image routing issue. The user mentioned they're on 2026.4.2 and there might be a newer version.\n\nActually, let me try a simpler test - can I try to call the image tool with a public URL? The image tool description says it accepts \"image: Single image path or URL\". Let me try with a well-known public image URL to see if the problem is with the file path or with the model/provider.","thinkingSignature":"c22a13e5a278151dc199c3cfca55996f5fb2c7e26c9101b8faeaae0b7a25b80a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w0w02cpj8rcw_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"这张图片里有什么？简单描述一下。","image":"https://httpbin.org/image/jpeg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26502,"output":251,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52904,"cost":{"input":0.0079506,"output":0.0003012,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00982086}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776156170618,"responseId":"062d310bfb86eb90f76a9e16d5105528"}}
