{"type":"message","id":"86013850","parentId":"1d334a6c","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:43:13.210Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Same error with a public URL! So the problem is definitely with the `minimax/MiniMax-V06` model not being found/registered in the system. This isn't a Feishu media download issue - the image tool itself can't find the V06 model.\n\nLet me check what models are actually available/registered in the system.","thinkingSignature":"9ba497166fb6994b3970d7466c0585b6998bc15c3e8e50f01c36f9714f2302b4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kwobprw7soxj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"MiniMax-V06\\|V06\\|vision\\|imageModel\" ~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-minimax/ 2>/dev/null | grep -v \".map:\" | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26799,"output":136,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53086,"cost":{"input":0.0080397,"output":0.00016319999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009771960000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776156186655,"responseId":"062d311b44223a17dab730f7f1268c05"}}
