{"type":"message","id":"45c63fa9","parentId":"59d078ed","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:43:31.655Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! The system is running OpenClaw 2026.4.12, but the workspace config says `lastTouchedVersion: \"2026.4.12\"`. Earlier the logs showed a version mismatch (2026.4.11 vs 2026.4.2), but now it seems to be running 2026.4.12.\n\nLet me check the actual OpenClaw installation to understand where the Minimax integration is and why V06 is showing as \"Unknown model\".","thinkingSignature":"8c92e202f054eccf90406d88a02db13f96cbee80b2dd66a814923e7f8188f6b2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6346t19cgwve_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /usr/local/lib/node_modules/openclaw/ | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":27179,"output":142,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53472,"cost":{"input":0.0081537,"output":0.0001704,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00989316}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776156204543,"responseId":"062d312d407b5db1b08c892f1e054615"}}
