{"type":"message","id":"eae0aad2","parentId":"9af8d730","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:57:09.584Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_q7t5gne5s53c_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"async function minimaxUnderstandImage(params) {\n\tconst apiKey = normalizeSecretInput(params.apiKey);\n\tif (!apiKey) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: apiKey required\");\n\tconst prompt = params.prompt.trim();\n\tif (!prompt) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: prompt required\");\n\tconst imageDataUrl = params.imageDataUrl.trim();\n\tif (!imageDataUrl) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: imageDataUrl required\");\n\tif (!/^data:image\\/(png|jpeg|webp);base64,/i.test(imageDataUrl)) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: imageDataUrl must be a base64 data:image/(png|jpeg|webp) URL\");\n\tconst host = coerceApiHost({\n\t\tapiHost: params.apiHost,\n\t\tmodelBaseUrl: params.modelBaseUrl\n\t});\n\tconst url = new URL(\"/v1/coding_plan/vlm\", host).toString();\n\tensureGlobalUndiciEnvProxyDispatcher();\n\tconst res = await fetch(url, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: {\n\t\t\tAuthorization: `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n\t\t\t\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n\t\t\t\"MM-API-Source\": \"OpenClaw\"\n\t\t},\n\t\tsignal: AbortSignal.timeout(6e4),\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({\n\t\t\tprompt,\n\t\t\timage_url: imageDataUrl\n\t\t})\n\t});\n\tconst traceId = res.headers.get(\"Trace-Id\") ?? \"\";\n\tif (!res.ok) {\n\t\tconst body = await res.text().catch(() => \"\");\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM request failed (${res.status} ${res.statusText}).${trace}${body ? ` Body: ${body.slice(0, 400)}` : \"\"}`);\n\t}\n\tconst json = await res.json().catch(() => null);\n\tif (!isRecord(json)) {\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM response was not JSON.${trace}`);\n\t}\n\tconst baseResp = isRecord(json.base_resp) ? json.base_resp : {};\n\tconst code = typeof baseResp.status_code === \"number\" ? baseResp.status_code : -1;\n\tif (code !== 0) {\n\t\tconst msg = (baseResp.status_msg ?? \"\").trim();\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM API error (${code})${msg ? `: ${msg}` : \"\"}.${trace}`);\n\t}\n\tconst content = pickString(json, \"content\").trim();\n\tif (!content) {\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM returned no content.${trace}`);\n\t}\n\treturn content;"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":23,"aggregated":"async function minimaxUnderstandImage(params) {\n\tconst apiKey = normalizeSecretInput(params.apiKey);\n\tif (!apiKey) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: apiKey required\");\n\tconst prompt = params.prompt.trim();\n\tif (!prompt) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: prompt required\");\n\tconst imageDataUrl = params.imageDataUrl.trim();\n\tif (!imageDataUrl) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: imageDataUrl required\");\n\tif (!/^data:image\\/(png|jpeg|webp);base64,/i.test(imageDataUrl)) throw new Error(\"MiniMax VLM: imageDataUrl must be a base64 data:image/(png|jpeg|webp) URL\");\n\tconst host = coerceApiHost({\n\t\tapiHost: params.apiHost,\n\t\tmodelBaseUrl: params.modelBaseUrl\n\t});\n\tconst url = new URL(\"/v1/coding_plan/vlm\", host).toString();\n\tensureGlobalUndiciEnvProxyDispatcher();\n\tconst res = await fetch(url, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: {\n\t\t\tAuthorization: `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n\t\t\t\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n\t\t\t\"MM-API-Source\": \"OpenClaw\"\n\t\t},\n\t\tsignal: AbortSignal.timeout(6e4),\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({\n\t\t\tprompt,\n\t\t\timage_url: imageDataUrl\n\t\t})\n\t});\n\tconst traceId = res.headers.get(\"Trace-Id\") ?? \"\";\n\tif (!res.ok) {\n\t\tconst body = await res.text().catch(() => \"\");\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM request failed (${res.status} ${res.statusText}).${trace}${body ? ` Body: ${body.slice(0, 400)}` : \"\"}`);\n\t}\n\tconst json = await res.json().catch(() => null);\n\tif (!isRecord(json)) {\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM response was not JSON.${trace}`);\n\t}\n\tconst baseResp = isRecord(json.base_resp) ? json.base_resp : {};\n\tconst code = typeof baseResp.status_code === \"number\" ? baseResp.status_code : -1;\n\tif (code !== 0) {\n\t\tconst msg = (baseResp.status_msg ?? \"\").trim();\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM API error (${code})${msg ? `: ${msg}` : \"\"}.${trace}`);\n\t}\n\tconst content = pickString(json, \"content\").trim();\n\tif (!content) {\n\t\tconst trace = traceId ? ` Trace-Id: ${traceId}` : \"\";\n\t\tthrow new Error(`MiniMax VLM returned no content.${trace}`);\n\t}\n\treturn content;","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776157029564}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fe1a4cd","parentId":"eae0aad2","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:57:37.380Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand completely! The `minimaxUnderstandImage` function calls `https://api.minimaxi.com/v1/coding_plan/vlm` (not the chat completions endpoint). This is a completely different API endpoint for vision/image understanding!\n\nThe endpoint is `/v1/coding_plan/vlm` - this is MiniMax's dedicated image understanding endpoint. The key insight is:\n\n**MiniMax V06 is NOT a vision model** - it's a text/LLM model. The actual image understanding model is `MiniMax-VL-01` (VL = Vision Language), and it has its own dedicated endpoint (`/v1/coding_plan/vlm`).\n\nSo the fix is:\n1. The `imageModel` in openclaw.json should be set to `MiniMax-VL-01` (the actual vision model), not `MiniMax-V06`\n2. OR we can use the `minimax-vlm` provider which specifically handles VL models\n\n\n3. But wait - I'm seeing conflicting information in the configuration. The error logs mention \"model does not support images\" for MiniMax-V06, yet the providers list shows V06 with `input: [\"text\", \"image\"]`. This suggests V06 might actually support images, but maybe only in certain contexts or through specific endpoints.\n\nThe real problem seems to be that when OpenClaw tries to route an image request through the standard chat completions API, V06 rejects it. The image understanding happens through a separate `/v1/coding_plan/vlm` endpoint instead. So the configuration needs to point to VL-01 specifically for image tasks, not V06. Let me check what other config options might work.","thinkingSignature":"b6c2c5223f1492464840d5ffff27bee63b67b1a163ef3ae4a5042fa494edf891"},{"type":"text","text":"找到根因了！🎯\n\n**问题根源：**\n- `MiniMax-V06` 是**文本模型**，不支持走标准 `/v1/chat/completions` 接口的图片输入\n- 真正的图片理解模型是 **`MiniMax-VL-01`**（VL = Vision Language），它有自己专门的 endpoint：`/v1/coding_plan/vlm`\n- OpenClaw 的 `imageModel` 配置成了 V06，但 V06 根本不是视觉模型\n\n**OpenClaw 内部的处理逻辑：**\n```\nV06 → 走 standard chat completions API → 报错\"model 不支持图片\"\nVL-01 → 走专门的 /v1/coding_plan/vlm 端点 → 正常工作\n```\n\n**修复方案：** 把 `imageModel` 从 `MiniMax-V06` 改成 `MiniMax-VL-01`：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_raj6jzfk981n_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n\n# Change imageModel from V06 to VL-01\ndata['agents']['defaults']['imageModel']['primary'] = 'minimax/MiniMax-VL-01'\n\n# Also check if VL-01 needs to be added to models list\nproviders = data.get('models', {}).get('providers', {})\nminimax = providers.get('minimax', {})\nmodels = minimax.get('models', [])\n\n# Find VL-01\nhas_vl01 = any(m.get('id') == 'MiniMax-VL-01' for m in models)\nprint('Has VL-01 in models:', has_vl01)\nprint('Current imageModel:', data['agents']['defaults']['imageModel'])\n\nwith open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('Done')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43941,"output":760,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70852,"cost":{"input":0.0131823,"output":0.0009119999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015663359999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776157029590,"responseId":"062d346724a560d8d2174265278a6299"}}
