{"type":"message","id":"4032ad82","parentId":"55dcd7ce","timestamp":"2026-04-14T08:57:58.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, V06 shows `input: ['text', 'image']` - but that's because V06 was configured with image capability in our config. However, the actual MiniMax API doesn't support V06 with images via the chat completions API.\n\nBut now I've set VL-01 as the imageModel, and VL-01 is added to the models list. However, there's a potential issue: the `isMinimaxVlmModel` function only checks for `MiniMax-VL-01` exactly. Let me verify that VL-01 will now work.\n\nActually, let me restart the gateway to apply the config changes, then test.","thinkingSignature":"e812bc586f454a5a013b0ae4e75c42a39acc46f8ada9cad3b3156d295f9f4e1c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n已更新配置，把 `MiniMax-VL-01` 加进去了（这就是真正的图片理解模型）。\n\n重启 Gateway 使配置生效：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5jpjiy7akqsm_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw gateway restart 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":45147,"output":200,"cacheRead":26151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71498,"cost":{"input":0.0135441,"output":0.00023999999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00156906,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015353160000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776157067976,"responseId":"062d348e382116b38906851f3a7c2965"}}
