{"type":"message","id":"a752a4f3","parentId":"668fc440","timestamp":"2026-04-14T09:13:50.708Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants a summary of how the image recognition problem was solved. Let me summarize the key findings and the fix.","thinkingSignature":"b93360f4815d5a58e8e49e08d8bec5a5bac7c0e90abe1144a6bb0ea7dd84dc2d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n总结一下解决过程：\n\n**① 定位根因**\n日志里看到两个关键错误：\n- `[media-understanding] image: failed reason=Model does not support images`\n- `[tools] image failed: Unknown model: minimax/MiniMax-V06`\n\n通过读 OpenClaw 源码发现：V06 是**文本模型**，真正的图片理解模型是 **`MiniMax-VL-01`**，走独立接口 `/v1/coding_plan/vlm`。\n\n**② 修复配置**\n把 `openclaw.json` 里的 `imageModel` 从 `minimax/MiniMax-V06` 改成 `minimax/MiniMax-VL-01`，并把 VL-01 加入模型列表。\n\n**③ 重启 Gateway**\n配置生效，图片识别恢复正常。\n\n---\n\n核心教训：**V06 和 VL-01 是两个完全不同的模型**，V06 文本能力强但不支持视觉，VL-01 才是专门处理图片的。套餐宣传的\"图像理解\"对应的是 VL-01，而不是 V06。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":543,"output":237,"cacheRead":71808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72588,"cost":{"input":0.0001629,"output":0.0002844,"cacheRead":0.00430848,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00475578}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776158020541,"responseId":"062d3846db636cf207011a37ac73172a"}}
